"Retain SVGImage across SVGImageForContainer::CreateViewInfo" (crbug
575312521; the bug is restricted, and no
CVE is listed for it yet), merged to the 156 branch on 2026-10-28 (first in
the 156.0.8078.83 tag, after the 156.0.8078.79 release) and proposed for
150. chromium/src main commit
ae76c84a47e410f556dc10aa925e057216872cc4 (main@{#1726943}) landed after the
157 branch point; its merge to the 157 branch (Gerrit CL 8672720) was still
open on 2026-10-29. This is that merge's patch, without its test. Drop it
once 157 has it.

